            "title": "McLaren Racing CEO talks F1 growth, Netflix, Big Tech sponsors",
            "description": "<p>McLaren Racing CEO Zak Brown sits down with Market Catalysts anchor <a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/author/julie-hyman/\">Julie Hyman</a> and Yahoo Finance senior autos reporter <a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/author/pras-subramanian/\">Pras Subramanian</a> to discuss the surge in popularity of Formula One (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/FWONK\">FWONK</a>), valuation growth, the impact of Netflix's <em>Drive to Survive</em> series (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/NFLX\">NFLX</a>), and the role of Big Tech companies in corporate sponsorships.</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more <a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-catalysts/\">Market Catalysts</a>.</p>",
