            "id": "60b90cad-30ec-3e61-b5b0-8911ba7950df",
            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "How to play F1 popularity: Liberty Media, Netflix, GM",
            "description": "<p>After talking with Formula One owner and Liberty Media founder and chairman John Malone, Yahoo Finance Executive Editor <a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/author/brian-sozzi/\">Brian Sozzi</a> examines how to invest in the competitive racing business.</p>\n<p>The Opening Bid Host, Crossmark Global Investments chief market strategist Victoria Fernandez, and Yahoo Finance Senior Reporter <a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/author/ines-ferre/\">Ines Ferr\u00e9</a> discuss investing in Liberty Media (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/FWONK\">FWONK</a>) and names with exposure to F1's success, like Netflix (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/NFLX\">NFLX</a>) and automaker General Motors (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/GM\">GM</a>).</p>\n<p>Check out Opening Bid Unfiltered's <a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/video/liberty-media-chair-john-malone-110039538.html\">full interview with Liberty Media founder John Malone</a>.</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more <a data-i13n=\"cpos:7;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/opening-bid/\">Opening Bid</a>.</p>",
            "summary": "After talking with Formula One owner and Liberty Media founder and chairman John Malone, Yahoo Finance Executive Editor Brian Sozzi examines how to invest in the competitive racing business. The Opening Bid Host, Crossmark Global Investments chief market strategist Victoria Fernandez, and Yahoo Finance Senior Reporter Ines Ferr\u00e9 discuss investing in Liberty Media (FWONK) and names with exposure to F1's success, like Netflix (NFLX) and automaker General Motors (GM). Check out Opening Bid Unfiltered's full interview with Liberty Media founder John Malone. To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more Opening Bid.",
